 One technique that I found to work in a potion shop involved quaffing
potions left right and centre hoping to find a really good one. I ended up
finding 2 potions of confusion, I lobbed one at the shopkeeper and while
he staggered around I ran out the door. This should work with paralysis
since the shopkeeper will unblock the door if you aren't close enough to exit.

 I rarely ever like to pay for goods, I prefer to grab everything I can
then sort through it hoping for a teleport spell or something. One tactic
I find works perfectly is to polymorph into a dragon, stand outside the
store and breath into it, the storekeeper will get hit but won't come out
to take revenge. I think I also once polymorphed the storekeeper into
something wimpy then pounded him.

